{"unit":1,"items":17,"pass":12,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 1","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 1 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>You and me</h2>\n      <p>Seventeen questions on Lessons 1&ndash;3: likes, <i>to be</i>, numbers and plurals. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>12 out of 17</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u1\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;12</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ coffee, but I don't like tea.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">liking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">likes</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">like</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ like Mondays.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">not</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">doesn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">don't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ you a student?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Yes, I ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">am</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">I'm Anna. Nice to ___ you!\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">meeting</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">meet</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">meets</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">one phone → two ___\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">phones</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">phonees</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">phone</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">How old ___ you?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">My phone number ___ 555 12 34.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ a teacher.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">I like tea, ___ I don't like coffee.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">because</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">but</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">and</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">13 = ___\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">thirteen</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">threeteen</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">thirty</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">I am twelve ___ old.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">years</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">year</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">yeares</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 13&ndash;17</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not. &middot; В письменных ответах важна орфография; заглавные буквы и точки &mdash; нет.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Type it in the negative: I like rain.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I don't like rain.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: You are a teacher.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Are you a teacher?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Type the plural: one book → two …<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"two books|books\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Answer NO: Are you a doctor?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"No, I'm not.|No, I am not.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: I likes music.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I like music.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}